%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: daceb89978d8e45c4b9afdb4dcc4c1aa, type: 3}
  m_Name: Murder
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  frames:
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3269b8f6a0f084327957c0e62f37d5b0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 1
    dialogueLine: I didn't need to be a detective to know someone was dead. I could
      smell the metallic tang of blood in the air.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "No\u2026"
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 563107da4e7244f8a8b338e4baaec6d9, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "He was\u2014 the lights went out and he just\u2014"
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 231320708aa324d678354913ac00d9c0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "How could this happen\u2014 nobody touched anything!"
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00eecea0f8d2943d3aa995fbef1d985d, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: I don't understand. I was speaking with him only moments before
      the lights went out.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e50fe5d95b48cf907723d5aff0248, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: The alarm went off and then... the lights went off...
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3269b8f6a0f084327957c0e62f37d5b0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 1
    dialogueLine: I was gone for maybe five minutes. Five minutes, and Maximilian
      Midas, the man who just announced he was taking everything and leaving, is
      dead on the floor of his own museum.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3269b8f6a0f084327957c0e62f37d5b0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 1
    dialogueLine: One of them did it. And I'm the only person in this room who can
      prove it.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "\u2026Nobody leaves this room."
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 563107da4e7244f8a8b338e4baaec6d9, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: Excuse me?
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: Whoever did this is still here. Which means walking out that door
      is not an option.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 231320708aa324d678354913ac00d9c0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "Okay. We should call someone... Police, ambulance... something\u2014"
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    isItalic: 1
    dialogueLine: Penny digs into her phone, tapping rapidly.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 231320708aa324d678354913ac00d9c0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: ...No signal?
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00eecea0f8d2943d3aa995fbef1d985d, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "That's not unusual in this building. The reception is\u2026 unreliable
      at best."
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e50fe5d95b48cf907723d5aff0248, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: So what, we just wait here with a dead body?
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e50fe5d95b48cf907723d5aff0248, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: We're locked in with no signal, a dead man, and five people who
      just found out they were fired.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: We're locked in with five people who all had a reason to hate him.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00eecea0f8d2943d3aa995fbef1d985d, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: You speak as though you've already decided this was murder!
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: I haven't decided anything. I'm a Detective, it's my job.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 563107da4e7244f8a8b338e4baaec6d9, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: '!!'
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 231320708aa324d678354913ac00d9c0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: '!!'
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e50fe5d95b48cf907723d5aff0248, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: '!!'
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00eecea0f8d2943d3aa995fbef1d985d, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: '!!'
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 563107da4e7244f8a8b338e4baaec6d9, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: Of course he invited a detective. That's very on brand for Max.
      Maybe he even wanted this!
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e50fe5d95b48cf907723d5aff0248, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "If he did\u2026 then we're already inside his game."
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00eecea0f8d2943d3aa995fbef1d985d, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: Then I assume you intend to determine what happened here.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 231320708aa324d678354913ac00d9c0, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: Yes. Please. Just figure it out.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: Here's what's going to happen. No one leaves. No one touches anything.
      And no one lies to me.
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "One of you turned this gala into a crime scene\u2026"
  - emotion: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 329b9859f8b23433da699c8ff652b3b2, type: 2}
    isItalic: 0
    dialogueLine: "...And I\u2019m going to find out who."
